       "letter": "B",
       "text": "Yes: the conclusion is true."
      },
      {
       "letter": "C",
       "text": "Yes: squares are rectangles, so they share every property."
      },
      {
       "letter": "D",
       "text": "No: no rectangle is a square."
      }
     ],
     "correct_letter": "A",
     "correct_answer": "No: the rectangles that are not rhombuses may all lie outside the squares."
    },
